.md
# Ray Tracing Demo
This is a short demonstration of a simple ray tracing program running on the GPU, controlled by the Wolfram Kernel. This compute shader is based entirely on Sam Lapere's work in the [OpenCL Path Tracing Tutorial](https://raytracey.blogspot.com/2016/11/opencl-path-tracing-tutorial-2-path.html).

